{"job_id":"F-75f7c503ac967166a321","family_id":"F-75f7c503ac967166a321","title":"이자제한법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":5,"target_id":"9d157d9623252ba341bf3c537981f6f1daebe9db67c3a3c7898097d916050f2b","source_hash":"8bb634ee6fe1ec52d297a2b89db515d684615842aa57e6931fec20c2fc175439","text":"利率限制法案"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":65,"target_id":"ec2c453e689d6033a9231ad9110c31883c2a7b18e107e3ddf82b53fdcafea958","source_hash":"836a05e8a888595cb754500eb80557be108121225a244bfda94679e0600c9a85","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是通过设定适当的利息最高限额，稳定国民经济生活，实现经济正义。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":65,"end":377,"target_id":"da251141a2cf358cd14c4a9a0db6a0769eb2faa4437e5c751b69afdd366377bb","source_hash":"76ea0cab3f21d0190b270d5e40bf97445e0a54ce3ad6d6493744043282139e79","text":"第2条（最高利息限额）\n① 货币贷款的最高合同利率由总统令确定，但年利率不得超过25%。<2011年7月25日修订；2014年1月14日修订>\n② 第1款规定的最高利率是指协议签订时的利率。\n③ 任何超过第1款规定最高利率的合同利息部分均无效。\n④ 如果债务人自愿支付的利息超过最高利率，则超额支付的利息金额应用于偿还本金，如果本金被清偿，债务人可以要求返还本金。\n第 1 款不适用于本金金额少于 100,000 韩元的贷款利息。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":377,"end":502,"target_id":"9dfa3892eb657db5877777a5e00595d2f1f39200dcd8533364b24022cdba4d1d","source_hash":"5dfc35c680c0943156867459bf809bbccb60a727440fe27b04dd7acf5c016810","text":"第三条（预先扣除利息）预先扣除利息的，如果扣除的金额超过根据第二条第一款规定的最高利率，以债务人实际收到的本金为基准计算的金额，则超出部分视为已用于偿还本金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":502,"end":750,"target_id":"d4f139e47d6ad4295e923fb5481fb789b0b510a7c0c487eac45491f146c167b6","source_hash":"0d4068f040c5c2514457fb2dc87cd5ac7682a95d58732ffcca10c96174a15d32","text":"第4条（视同权益）\n① 债权人因贷款而收到的任何款项，无论其名称如何——例如存款、折扣、费用、扣款、预付款或任何其他名称——均应视为利息。<2011年7月25日修订>\n② 债务人同意承担与货币贷款相关的付款义务的，如果根据该义务产生的原因、相关法律法规、义务内容以及商业交易的一般原则，该义务的性质原本应由债权人承担，则该义务应视为利息。<2011年7月25日新增>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":750,"end":843,"target_id":"e6c48d665f1cb9d6aabcbf4c11f5c392e254a1507346b007cbbae84ed7882cef","source_hash":"156bb448cf8daadfb1f558578adb5f919262ebf9d61d84c921a711222169f85d","text":"第五条（对复利协议的限制）任何对利息再次支付利息的复利协议，对于超过第二条第一款规定最高利率的部分，均属无效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":843,"end":934,"target_id":"2063648fcc3f9d26fe25f43fbcb9a01cde60e9e57d54c2660bfb6c041f66484b","source_hash":"ac77c798c22e527d6640718a33142c4e47a60628e20b20cdd09dbf04df5966bd","text":"第六条（减少损害赔偿）法院认为一方当事人就未履行金钱义务所约定的损害赔偿金额不合理，可以将其减少至合理数额。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":934,"end":1076,"target_id":"2326cf569e41350ffecd3aba9493f09dcf4f0911e95cb8f5645fb034949551a2","source_hash":"2c1c9a21f35f406280ce28a2a7a3dc25c0d1f8f782d57cea6d750474ab1cdd8d","text":"第七条（适用范围）本法不适用于已根据其他法律完成授权、许可或登记的金融企业和贷款企业，也不适用于依据《贷款企业登记等及金融消费者保护法》第二条第七款规定非法私人放贷者。<2009年1月21日修订；2025年1月21日更新>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1076,"end":1183,"target_id":"6c0b9a05b0aa1177b0ffcfcac7dc28ebc9f2779b2a271d42c30f67f5276c1f78","source_hash":"0f0acf99b5aa29dad3be05cd6efa70d9d4d697eab971e772495fce183d7d426d","text":"第8条（处罚）\n① 任何人收取超过第二条第一款规定最高利率的利息，处一年以下有期徒刑或者一千万韩元以下罚金。\n② 第1款规定的监禁和罚款可以同时执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1183,"end":1323,"target_id":"eeb0096843efc38d6b6fefeaeab4fe1a745b4305c789d04509f3deedbb56c6c1","source_hash":"ce3844db27b140bfa7bd613a13cde76a490dc7f726e39b656ab5a78667d74a45","text":"补充规定 <第8322号，2007年3月29日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）对于本法实施前已建立的贷款关系的合同利率，自本法生效之日起，利率也应按照本法计算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1323,"end":1375,"target_id":"1140bf455dbad7eaf4d809cde3d23e315365e71dc4ef83eaa8a505b0eb391af1","source_hash":"bc092a277abe1439ef230448f4f0f1b0c31ee710616e432d8a47ba571d496675","text":"补充条款（贷款业务登记等及金融消费者保护法）<第9344号法案，2009年1月21日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1375,"end":1422,"target_id":"91621cbac5f14291b541ff95f0b1b74d623f83a242d249694c8c896a4a15eb3c","source_hash":"4fa885529d27745733697f970a6158cd7179a6fc497d7318cac75d9ff08614a0","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1422,"end":1439,"target_id":"5e10d325adf4edf619d14948eaafe96975079f21debeca1ea824022b28db161c","source_hash":"9c668f5a2d31a12403cc16a9e4f5410caea7fad78df52e49a6877577af85a298","text":"省略第 2 至 8 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1439,"end":1478,"target_id":"5ba474ea306c06ba8385fa18c02ed6e30156f59473297ee706dcaa543e9b9d66","source_hash":"415925aee71aa9f0f1664a1dacbb60f9d7939cc7b16f75bd9099968607c36ce2","text":"第九条（修改其他法律）利率限制法部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1478,"end":1563,"target_id":"0e3b5598a75218a9d506b41c6a2802f511294644da4ad7e98c72906a85d46c75","source_hash":"792ded97b41e29f7578f908b127a0f7c4d7b9a81292baa005823c0628bf03107","text":"  在第 7 条中，“在贷款业务中”应改为“就贷款业务和根据《贷款业务登记法》第 9-4 条规定未登记的贷款人而言”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1563,"end":1702,"target_id":"e03ece46cba2d1e2c051abfd71430690979bba5b5ada148bc2145b9881e038e3","source_hash":"4ee9aaa5200b8400e97d705c1c662200c450ded0977578634ae2a2129b559e85","text":"补充规定 <第10925号，2011年7月25日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n②（适用）关于本法实施前已确定的货币贷款合同利率，利率应自本法实施之日起按照本法计算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1702,"end":1726,"target_id":"b7f5d3f6db3ac0659de8dc8fa84d4c353b7e7ac6e468d94cb1c57d4acafa004f","source_hash":"95fae14d658ef5c13f61e4439c52ddd73f83fb5dffc06bbd5fbe6240f30b7a45","text":"补充规定 <第12227号，2014年1月14日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1726,"end":1765,"target_id":"45e6c1d8cab496184aedd69d4990ae55b927a689754c8f2efc98375e40b09304","source_hash":"25ab8090219c7238abfcb9c5def1d259d4a6ffcd42cc55b280b8993c845bc68c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1765,"end":1827,"target_id":"ff9e74d61b0fc53b2ef663ffee01f61bb969f27d89c2a8c50af650572ba30ab8","source_hash":"432ebb6b4e81e10af065eb8e6c98f394fbc82d4d6d224074ec68097a3a282e85","text":"第二条（适用范围）第二条第一款的修正规定适用于本法实施后首次订立或续签的合同。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1827,"end":1880,"target_id":"afd0f43b98c4dba28f0412b4106cb8d0edbb95b8df61cd28142ee7022ba5398d","source_hash":"8db5d28477b962374b8816a972f405675f681204ebdf8c062d06a3f5c51677aa","text":"补充条款（贷款业务登记等及金融消费者保护法）<第20714号法案，2025年1月21日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1880,"end":1919,"target_id":"d644419e4b2fc2ca4c4b4ea27fe7bc77beb9d56ba23ef97ccd02712bebb82712","source_hash":"25ab8090219c7238abfcb9c5def1d259d4a6ffcd42cc55b280b8993c845bc68c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1919,"end":1936,"target_id":"d95c19bc15a1eb2b2eefd09b316495c73620ee0cfa7b392ca9387251e2b75eb7","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1936,"end":1985,"target_id":"5e6f2e2955ba1b5d93ed28349946ed1857cde67c35264bcd601031884f4de581","source_hash":"bb5f232369c0f8f018f28151df40cb46f1c802326660c976b3049fe3f5c83939","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 《利率限制法》部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010404-268667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1985,"end":2047,"target_id":"b0f8846b71063fc225d4b6c8823ed889b6d5097e259bb207ad7869b7c9cccd6f","source_hash":"24f92f2be1bdbfaf2c2249f16a8c5545d036fbe4c31b4562d830e26847795b50","text":"  在第 7 条中，“根据第 9-4 条规定未登记的放贷人”应改为“根据第 2 条第 7 款规定非法私人放贷人”。\n\n  ③ 省略"}]}